 "note": "exact 2026-11-23 (phase B, source forms only, no compiler change): find.c of System III + the WEGA sccsid, chdir(strlen(Pathname)? Pathname: \"/\") in descend, the globals declared in the order of the bss of the original, and in scomp an unused label in front of the second if (a label no jump names: OLD_D3K forgets the parameter s there, so it gets its home at the entry, ld %0000(r15),r5, and is reloaded, cpb %0001(r15),#%2D). ccv0p with the stdio.h of the tree; libc-v7.a with the members of find added (popen, fgets 0_2, puts, sleep 0_2 with the ret_buf of 10 words, data 0_1, length 0_3). On the way, measured in a copy and refuted as compiler rules: a char parameter not kept at a jump (rmconv), a parameter in r5 (mk), the loops of d3klabel swapped (mklong), busy at the jump (10 functions of the passes), a byte register (none is taken in scomp)."
